<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About Us — Reservia</title>
    <%- include("includes/styles.ejs") %>
    <style>
        .about-page {
            background: #0d0d0d;
            padding-top: 140px;
            color: #fff;
        }

        .about-hero {
            position: relative;
            height: 60vh;
            min-height: 400px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            text-align: center;
            overflow: hidden;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(166,123,91,0.2);
        }

        .about-hero video {
            position: absolute;
            top: 50%; left: 50%;
            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
            min-width: 100%; min-height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
            opacity: 0.3;
            z-index: 0;
        }

        .about-hero-content {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }

        .about-hero-content h1 {
            font-family: 'Forum', cursive;
            font-size: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 6rem);
            color: hsl(42, 48%, 77%);
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            letter-spacing: 0.1em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .about-hero-content p {
            font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.3em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
        }

        .story-section {
            padding: 100px 24px;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            gap: 60px;
            align-items: center;
        }

        @media(min-width: 992px) {
            .story-section { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
        }

        .story-text h2 {
            font-family: 'Forum', cursive;
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            color: hsl(42, 48%, 77%);
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            line-height: 1.1;
        }

        .story-text p {
            font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .story-images {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .story-images img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
            border-radius: 2px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(166,123,91,0.2);
        }

        .img-tall {
            grid-row: span 2;
            height: 400px;
        }
        
        .img-short {
            height: 190px;
        }

        .philosophy-section {
            background: #111;
            padding: 100px 24px;
            text-align: center;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(166,123,91,0.1);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(166,123,91,0.1);
        }

        .philosophy-container {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .philosophy-section h2 {
            font-family: 'Forum', cursive;
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            color: #fff;
            margin-bottom: 60px;
        }

        .pillars {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 40px;
        }

        .pillar h3 {
            font-family: 'Forum', cursive;
            font-size: 2rem;
            color: hsl(42, 48%, 77%);
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .pillar p {
            font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
            font-size: 1rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <%- include("includes/header.ejs", { image: images }) %>

    <div class="about-page">
        <section class="about-hero">
            <video autoplay muted loop>
                <source src="<%= images[1] %>" type="video/mp4">
            </video>
            <div class="about-hero-content">
                <h1>Our Story</h1>
                <p>Culinary Excellence Since 1998</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="story-section">
            <div class="story-text">
                <h2>A Legacy of Fine Taste</h2>
                <p>What began as a small, intimate gathering of culinary enthusiasts has blossomed into Reservia—a sanctuary for those who appreciate the finer things in life. Our founder believed that dining is not just about eating, but about the theater, the ambiance, and the memories forged around the table.</p>
                <p>Today, our Michelin-trained chefs continue to push the boundaries of modern gastronomy while paying deep respect to classic techniques. Every ingredient is sourced with intention, every plate designed with passion.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="story-images">
                <img src="<%= images[3] %>" class="img-tall" alt="Chef at work">
                <div style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:20px;">
                    <img src="<%= images[4] %>" class="img-short" alt="Elegant dining">
                    <img src="<%= images[5] %>" class="img-short" alt="Kitchen details">
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="philosophy-section">
            <div class="philosophy-container">
                <h2>Our Pillars</h2>
                <div class="pillars">
                    <div class="pillar">
                        <h3>Mastery</h3>
                        <p>We believe in the relentless pursuit of perfection. From the sourcing of truffles to the precise temperature of our wines.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="pillar">
                        <h3>Elegance</h3>
                        <p>Design and atmosphere are paramount. Our dining room is a carefully curated space meant to elevate every sense.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="pillar">
                        <h3>Hospitality</h3>
                        <p>True luxury is invisible. Our staff anticipates your needs before they arise, offering seamless, personalized service.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </div>

    <%- include("includes/footer.ejs") %>

    <script type="module" src="https://unpkg.com/ionicons@5.5.2/dist/ionicons/ionicons.esm.js"></script>
    <script nomodule src="https://unpkg.com/ionicons@5.5.2/dist/ionicons/ionicons.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
